        "\n",
        "1.  $P=M_0^{\\frac{1}{2}} K M_0^{\\frac{1}{2}}$\n",
        "2.  Find the Eigenvalues and Eigenvectors of $P$, $\\{\\bar{\\Psi_0}, \\ \\bar{\\Lambda_0}\\}= \\texttt{eig} (P)$.\n",
        "    - Mode frequencies are the Eigenvalues of $P$ in $\\bar{\\Lambda_0}$.\n",
        "3.  Find the Mode Shapes, $\\Psi_0 = M_0^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\bar{\\Psi_0}$\n"
